# Taskcover Agency — Design System

This document is the source of truth for visual design. All components and
pages must conform to it.

## 1. Bright-only design direction

- **Light theme only.** No dark website theme.
- Main backgrounds must be white, off-white, or light blue-tinted.
- Dark text is allowed; dark surfaces are not.
- No black or dark navy hero sections.
- Feel: premium **“Search Intelligence Command Center”**, not a generic SEO
  agency template.

